# ai-hub pulse configuration. Committed to the repository: NO SECRETS HERE.
# The team key and actor go in .env (see .env.example), never in this file.
#
# Format: KEY=VALUE, one per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# The organizer replaces every FILL_ME placeholder with the team's real IDs.
#   <STAGE>_NODE       ai-hub node ID for the stage
#   <STAGE>_STARTED    ai-hub activity ID for "stage-started"
#   <STAGE>_COMPLETED  ai-hub activity ID for "stage-completed"

